ERROR [aero1553::cli] Cannot render a calendar timestamp: this recording uses the Standard timestamp encoding, a free-running counter with no epoch. No year places it on a calendar. IRIG-B carries no year and no timezone, so a calendar rendering is refused rather than guessed at. Use --output-time-format doy to write the day-of-year form instead.
